incident :the_borrowed_season do
  name "The Borrowed Season"
  tags :biotech, :symbiosis, :medicine, :legibility
  prominence :marginal

  prose <<~PROSE
    The clinic cycle at #{ref :yumen_gate, "Yumen Gate"} in 2085 that ended the practice of carrying a #{ref :the_season_credit, "credit"} from one class of bed to another.

    The bed was a #{ref :severed_strains, "pruned strain"} for temporary exposure, four months on the clinic floor, renewed at #{ref :xincheng_yard, "the Xincheng yard"} on a credit read the previous melt off a set grown on a different substrate. Nothing about the renewal was irregular. The trace ran four days at five metres, the joins held, the card was written, and the credit line on its face named a class that was not this bed's.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :course, heading: "The Fourth Month"
    A four-day trace reads whether a bed gets out. It does not read how large the bed has become, and size is what pruning is for.

    In the fourth month two travellers exposed a day apart came off the bed with the same thing in them: a shape neither had been given, that the first had brought in. A pruned bed holds nothing between exposures, and the clinic's whole licence to use one rests on that. #{ref :ma_renqing, "Ma Renqing"} had the bed off the floor the same afternoon, the clinic days void for the cycle, and the fees returned off #{ref :the_gate_schedule, "the schedule"} at the posted rate.

    Her own card for the cycle, which she did not produce, held the thing the station's card could not: eleven beds renewed that year under a credit, seven of them read off classes that did not match, and every one of the seven a substrate that grows faster than the substrate the credit was made on. The bed was burned with its stand, its trays and the cell it stood in.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :aftermath, heading: "The Class Line"
    #{ref :the_thorong_book, "The book at the pass"} was not wrong and was not consulted. What had gone wrong sat between the reading and the renewal, in a yard four days' journey and a border away from the room where the figure was written, where a clerk had taken a ratio off one line and applied it to a bed the line said nothing about.

    A credit now names the class on the form and on the card, and a card renewed under a mismatched class is not renewed. The yard's throughput fell by a fifth in the following year, cards expired that would have held, and the waiting list lengthened; the crossings collected the lineage-audit rate per documented generation on every expired card that came through, which the #{ref :the_preservationists, "Preservationists"} pay more of than anyone.

    Ma Renqing's standing answer to inspectors who ask why a station cannot simply read the credit itself is the one she gives about everything upstream of a seal. The station audits what it grows. It takes a season on paper, from a room it has never seen, in a hand nobody at Yumen can identify.
  PROSE

  log "2026-08-09 — The failure mode is the transferability limit on an acceleration factor: a factor established on one material class systematically misstates a class that ages faster, and the standards say so explicitly. Sited here on substrate-driven growth rate, so the short trace passes every bed while the fast classes pass the size threshold inside a cycle. Reason: the case had to be a paper failure between two competent readings rather than a fault in either, because both regimes are sound and only their join is not."
end
